<section class="sec musical" id="musical" aria-labelledby="mus-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mt-cq">
      <div class="mt-musical">
        <span class="mt-kicker">The musical · mid-July 2027</span>
        <h2 class="mt-musical__title" id="mus-h">
          Trap Tap Twins<span>NY to B-More</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-musical__text">
          From New York roots to Baltimore dreams, TRAP TAP TWINS: NY to B-More brings a story of brotherhood, ambition
